0"}, {"name": "Retreat Cost", "displayName": "Retreat Cost", "value": "4"}, {"name": "Attack 1", "displayName": "Attack 1", "value": "[Colorless][Colorless] Heap Up (40+)<br> Search your discard pile for all Energy cards and show them to your opponent. If you find any Metal Special Energy cards there this attack does 40 damage plus 30 more damage. Put all of those Energy cards on top of your deck. Shuffle your deck afterward."}, {"name": "Attack 2", "displayName": "Attack 2", "value": "[Metal][Metal][Metal][Metal] Hard Metal (60+)<br> You may do 60 damage plus 40 more damage. If you do, Aggron does 40 damage to itself."}, {"name": "Flavor Text", "displayName": "Flavor Text", "value": "While seeking iron for food, it digs by breaking through bedrock with its steel horns."}]}, {"productId": 605820, "name": "Ariados", "cleanName": "Ariados", "imageUrl": "https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/605820_200w.jpg", "categoryId": 85, "groupId": 23974, "url": "https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/605820/pokemon-japan-dp2-secret-of-the-lakes-ariados", "modifiedOn": "2025-08-19T19:09:15.537", "imageCount": 1, "presaleInfo": {"isPresale": false, "releasedOn": null, "note": null}, "extendedData": [{"name": "Rarity", "displayName": "Rarity", "value": "Rare"}, {"name": "Description", "displayName": "Description", "value": "<strong>Pok\u00e9-BODY: Sticky</strong> The Retreat Cost for each player's Pok\u00e9mon (excluding Ariados) is Colorless more."}, {"name": "CardType", "displayName": "Card Type", "value": "Grass"}, {"name": "HP", "displayName": "HP", "value": "80"}, {"name": "Stage", "displayName": "Stage", "value": "Stage 1"}, {"name": "Weakness", "displayName": "Weakness", "value": "Fire +20"}, {"name": "Retreat Cost", "displayName": "Retreat Cost", "value": "1"}, {"name": "Attack 1", "displayName": "Attack 1", "value": "[Grass][Colorless] Offensive Needle (20)<br> Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pok\u00e9mon is now Poisoned. If tails, the Defending Pok\u00e9mon is now Paralyzed."}, {"name": "Flavor Text", "displayName": "Flavor Text", "value": "It attaches silk to its prey and sets it free. Later, it tracks the silk to find the prey and its friends."}]}, {"productId": 605821, "name": "Kricketune", "cleanName": "Kricketune", "imageUrl": "https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/605821_200w.jpg", "categoryId": 85, "groupId": 23974, "url": "https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/605821/pokemon-japan-dp2-secret-of-the-lakes-kricketune", "modifiedOn": "2025-08-20T22:37:43.803", "imageCount": 1, "presaleInfo": {"isPresale": false, "releasedOn": null, "note": null}, "extendedData": [{"name": "Rarity", "displayName": "Rarity", "value": "Rare"}, {"name": "CardType", "displayName": "Card Type", "value": "Grass"}, {"name": "HP", "displayName": "HP", "value": "80"}, {"name": "Stage", "displayName": "Stage", "value": "Stage 1"}, {"name": "Weakness", "displayName": "Weakness", "value": "Fire +20"}, {"name": "Retreat Cost", "displayName": "Retreat Cost", "value": "2"}, {"name": "Attack 1", "displayName": "Attack 1", "value": "[Colorless][Colorless] Sore Performance (20)<br> The Defending Pok\u00e9mon is now Asleep."}, {"name": "Attack 2", "displayName": "Attack 2", "value": "[Grass][Grass] Concerto (40+)<br> Does 40 damage plus 10 more damage for each Kricketot and each Kricketune you have in play."}, {"name": "Flavor Text", "displayName": "Flavor Text", "value": "It crosses its knifelike arms in front of its chest when it cries. It can compose melodies ad lib."}]}, {"productId": 605822, "name": "Chimecho", "cleanName": "Chimecho", "imageUrl": "https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/605822_200w.jpg", "categoryId": 85, "groupId": 23974, "url": "https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/605822/pokemon-japan-dp2-secret-of-the-lakes-chimecho", "modifiedOn": "2025-08-19T21:55:09.527", "imageCount": 1, "presaleInfo": {"isPresale": false, "releasedOn": null, "note": null}, "extendedData": [{"name": "Rarity", "displayName": "Rarity", "value": "Rare"}, {"name": "CardType", "displayName": "Card Type", "value": "Psychic"}, {"name": "HP", "displayName": "HP", "value": "70"}, {"name": "Stage", "displayName": "Stage", "value": "Basic"}, {"name": "Weakness", "displayName": "Weakness", "value": "Psychic +20"}, {"name": "Retreat Cost", "displayName": "Retreat Cost", "value": "1"}, {"name": "Attack 1", "displayName": "Attack 1", "value": "[Colorless] Call In<br> Draw a card. If Chingling is anywhere under Chimecho, draw 2 more cards."}, {"name": "Attack 2", "displayName": "Attack 2", "value": "[Psychic] Strange Bell (20)<br> If the Defending Pok\u00e9mon is a Basic Pok\u00e9mon, that Pok\u00e9mon is Confused."}, {"name": "Flavor Text", "displayName": "Flavor Text", "value": "To knock foes flying, it makes the air shudder with its cries. It converses using seven cries."}]}, {"productId": 605823, "name": "Unown I", "cleanName": "Unown I", "imageUrl": "https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/605823_200w.jpg", "categoryId": 85, "groupId": 23974, "url": "https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/605823/pokemon-japan-dp2-secret-of-the-lakes-unown-i", "modifiedOn": "2025-08-19T18:33:05.287", "imageCount": 1, "presaleInfo": {"isPresale": false, "releasedOn": null, "note": null}, "extendedData": [{"name": "Rarity", "displayName": "Rarity", "value": "Rare"}, {"name": "Description", "displayName": "Description", "value": "<strong>Pok\u00e9-POWER: ITEM</strong> Once during your turn <em>(before your attack)</em>, if you have Unown I, Unown T, Unown E, and Unown M on your Bench, you may search your deck for a Trainer card, show it to your opponent, and put it into your hand. Shuffle your deck afterward. You can't use more than 1 ITEM Pok\u00e9-Power each turn."}, {"name": "CardType", "displayName": "Card Type", "value": "Psychic"}, {"name": "HP", "displayName": "HP", "value": "50"}, {"name": "Stage", "displayName": "Stage", "value": "Basic"}, {"name": "Weakness", "displayName": "Weakness", "value": "Psychic +10"}, {"name": "Retreat Cost", "displayName": "Retreat Cost", "value": "1"}, {"name": "Attack 1", "displayName": "Attack 1", "value": "[Colorless] Hidden Power<br> Choose an Energy card attached to the Defending Pok\u00e9mon and put it face down. Treat that card as a Special Energy card that provides Colorless Energy and doesn't have any effect other than providing Energy. Put that card face up at the end of your opponent's next turn."}, {"name": "Flavor Text", "displayName": "Flavor Text", "value": "Shaped like ancient writing, it is a huge mystery whether language or Unown came first."}]}, {"productId": 605824, "name": "Abomasnow", "cleanName": "Abomasnow", "imageUrl": "https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/605824_200w.jpg", "categoryId": 85, "groupId": 23974, "url": "https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/605824/pokemon-japan-dp2-secret-of-the-lakes-abomasnow", "modifiedOn": "2025-08-19T18:51:59.703", "imageCount": 1, "presaleInfo": {"isPresale": false, "releasedOn": null, "note": null}, "extendedData": [{"name": "Rarity", "displayName": "Rarity", "value": "Rare"}, {"name": "Description", "displayName": "Description", "value": "<strong>Pok\u00e9-BODY: Glacier Snow</strong> If Abomasnow is your Active Pok\u00e9mon and is damaged by an opponent's attack <em>(even if Abomasnow is Knocked Out)</em>, the Attacking Pok\u00e9mon is now Asleep."}, {"name": "CardType", "displayName": "Card Type", "value": "Grass"}, {"name": "HP", "displayName": "HP", "value": "100"}, {"name": "Stage", "displayName": "Stage", "value": "Stage 1"}, {"name": "Weakness", "displayName": "Weakness", "value": "Fire +30"}, {"name": "Retreat Cost", "displayName": "Retreat Cost", "value": "3"}, {"name": "Attack 1", "displayName": "Attack 1", "value": "[Water][Colorless][Colorless] Heavy Blizzard (60)<br> Flip a coin. If heads, put 1 damage counter on each of your opponent's Benched Pok\u00e9mon."}, {"name": "Flavor Text", "displayName": "Flavor Text", "value": "It whips up blizzards in mountains that are always buried in snow. It is the abominable snowman."}]}, {"productId": 605825, "name": "Exeggutor", "cleanName": "Exeggutor", "imageUrl": "https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/605825_200w.jpg", "categoryId": 85, "groupId": 23974, "url": "https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/605825/pokemon-japan-dp2-secret-of-the-lakes-exeggutor", "modifiedOn": "2025-08-20T22:35:49.343", "imageCount": 1, "presaleInfo": {"isPresale": false, "releasedOn": null, "note": null}, "extendedData": [{"name": "Rarity", "displayName": "Rarity", "value": "Rare"}, {"name": "CardType", "displayName": "Card Type", "value": "Grass"}, {"name": "HP", "displayName": "HP", "value": "90"}, {"name": "Stage", "displayName": "Stage", "value": "Stage 1"}, {"name": "Weakness", "displayName": "Weakness", "value": "Fire +20"}, {"name": "Retreat Cost", "displayName": "Retreat Cost", "value": "2"}, {"name": "Attack 1", "displayName": "Attack 1", "value": "[Colorless] String Bomb (30x)<br> Flip a coin for each basic Energy card attached to Exeggutor and to the Defending Pok\u00e9mon. This attack does 30 damage times the number of heads."}, {"name": "Attack 2", "displayName": "Attack 2", "value": "[Grass] Nutritional Support<br> Search your deck for up to 2 Grass Energy cards and attach them to any of your Pok\u00e9mon in any way you like. Shuffle your deck afterward."}, {"name": "Flavor Text", "displayName": "Flavor Text", "value": "It is called \"The Walking Jungle.\" If a head grows too big, it falls off and becomes an Exeggcute."}]}, {"productId": 605826, "name": "Crobat", "cleanName": "Crobat", "imageUrl": "https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/605826_200w.jpg", "categoryId": 85, "groupId": 23974, "url": "https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/605826/pokemon-japan-dp2-secret-of-the-lakes-crobat", "modifiedOn": "2025-08-19T18:57:01.72", "imageCount": 1, "presaleInfo": {"isPresale": false, "releasedOn": null, "note": null}, "extendedData": [{"name": "Rarity", "displayName": "Rarity", "value": "Rare"}, {"name": "Description", "displayName": "Description", "value": "<strong>Pok\u00e9-POWER: Evolutionary Toxic</strong> Once during your turn, when you play Crobat from your hand to evolve 1 of your Pok\u00e9mon, you may choose 1 of the Defending Pok\u00e9mon.  That Pok\u00e9mon is now Poisoned.  Put 2 damage counters instead of 1 on that Pok\u00e9mon between turns."}, {"name": "CardType", "displayName": "Card Type", "value": "Psychic"}, {"name": "HP", "displayName": "HP", "value": "100"}, {"name": "Stage", "displayName": "Stage", "value": "Stage 2"}, {"name": "Weakness", "displayName": "Weakness", "value": "Psychic +30"}, {"name": "Resistance", "displayName": "Resistance", "value": "Fighting -20"}, {"name": "Attack 1", "displayName": "Attack 1", "value": "[Psychic][Psychic] Strike and Fade<br> Choose 1 of your opponent's Pok\u00e9mon. This attack does 50 damage to that Pok\u00e9mon. <em>(Don't apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pok\u00e9mon.)</em> Flip a coin. If tails, shuffle Crobat and all cards attached to it back into your deck."}, {"name": "Flavor Text", "displayName": "Flavor Text", "value": "Having four wings enables it to fly faster and more quietly. It turns active when the night comes."}]}, {"productId": 605827, "name": "Mr. Mime", "cleanName": "Mr Mime", "imageUrl": "https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/605827_200w.jpg", "categoryId": 85, "groupId": 23974, "url": "https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/605827/pokemon-japan-dp2-secret-of-the-lakes-mr-mime", "modifiedOn": "2025-08-20T22:48:44.66", "imageCount": 1, "presaleInfo": {"isPresale": false, "releasedOn": null, "note": null}, "extendedData": [{"name": "Rarity", "displayName": "Rarity", "value": "Rare"}, {"name": "Description", "displayName": "Description", "value": "<strong>Pok\u00e9-BODY: Airy Wall</strong> If your opponent's Pok\u00e9mon that has 2 or less Energy cards attached to it attacks Mr. Mime, prevent all damage done to Mr. Mime from that attack. If Mime Jr. is anywhere under Mr. Mime, prevent all effects of that attack, including damage, done to Mr. Mime."}, {"name": "CardType", "displayName": "Card Type", "value": "Psychic"}, {"name": "HP", "displayName": "HP", "value": "70"}, {"name": "Stage", "displayName": "Stage", "value": "Basic"}, {"name": "Weakness", "displayName": "Weakness", "value": "Psychic +20"}, {"name": "Retreat Cost", "displayName": "Retreat Cost", "value": "1"}, {"name": "Attack 1", "displayName": "Attack 1", "value": "[Psychic][Colorless] Trick Play<br> Put a coin next to your Active Pok\u00e9mon without showing your opponent and cover it with your hand. Your opponent guesses if the coin is heads or tails. If he or she is wrong, this attack does 50 damage to the Defending Pok\u00e9mon. If he or she is right, Mr. Mime does 20 damage to itself, and this attack's damage isn't affected by Weakness or Resistance."}, {"name": "Flavor Text", "displayName": "Flavor Text", "value": "It is a pantomime expert that can create invisible but solid walls using miming gestures."}]}, {"productId": 605828, "name": "Mantine", "cleanName": "Mantine", "imageUrl": "https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/605828_200w.jpg", "categoryId": 85, "groupId": 23974, "url": "https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/605828/pokemon-japan-dp2-secret-of-the-lakes-mantine", "modifiedOn": "2025-08-20T22:39:46.54", "imageCount": 1, "presaleInfo": {"isPresale": false, "releasedOn": null, "note": null}, "extendedData": [{"name": "Rarity", "displayName": "Rarity", "value": "Rare"}, {"name": "Description", "displayName": "Description", "value": "<strong>Pok\u00e9-BODY: Jumbo Fin</strong> If Mantyke is anywhere under Mantine, the Retreat Cost for each of your Water Pok\u00e9mon is ColorlessColorless less."}, {"name": "CardType", "displayName": "Card Type", "value": "Water"}, {"name": "HP", "displayName": "HP", "value": "80"}, {"name": "Stage", "displayName": "Stage", "value": "Basic"}, {"name": "Weakness", "displayName": "Weakness", "value": "Lightning +20"}, {"name": "Resistance", "displayName": "Resistance", "value": "Fighting -20"}, {"name": "Retreat Cost", "displayName": "Retreat Cost", "value": "1"}, {"name": "Attack 1", "displayName": "Attack 1", "value": "[Water][Water] Giant Wave (50)<br> Mantine can't use Giant Wave during your next turn."}, {"name": "Flavor Text", "displayName": "Flavor Text", "value": "When the waves are calm, one may encounter a swarm of Mantine swimming as if they are in flight."}]}, {"productId": 605829, "name": "Sudowoodo", "cleanName": "Sudowoodo", "imageUrl": "https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/605829_200w.jpg", "categoryId": 85, "groupId": 23974, "url": "https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/605829/pokemon-japan-dp2-secret-of-the-lakes-sudowoodo", "modifiedOn": "2025-08-20T22:42:31.667", "imageCount": 1, "presaleInfo": {"isPresale": false, "releasedOn": null, "note": null}, "extendedData": [{"name": "Rarity", "displayName": "Rarity", "value": "Rare"}, {"name": "CardType", "displayName": "Card Type", "value": "Fighting"}, {"name": "HP", "displayName": "HP", "value": "80"}, {"name": "Stage", "displayName": "Stage", "value": "Basic"}, {"name": "Weakness", "displayName": "Weakness", "value": "Water x2"}, {"name": "Retreat Cost", "displayName": "Retreat Cost", "value": "1"}, {"name": "Attack 1", "displayName": "Attack 1", "value": "[Colorless] Sidestep (20)<br> If Bonsly is anywhere under Sudowoodo, flip a coin. If heads, prevent all effects of an attack, including damage, done to Sudowoodo during your opponent's next turn."}, {"name": "Attack 2", "displayName": "Attack 2", "value": "[Fighting][Fighting] Persuade (30)<br> Your opponent switches the Defending Pok\u00e9mon with 1 of his or her Benched Pok\u00e9mon. The new Defending Pok\u00e9mon can't retreat during your opponent's next turn."}, {"name": "Flavor Text", "displayName": "Flavor Text", "value": "Despite appearing to be a tree, its body is closer to rocks and stones. It is very weak to water."}]}, {"productId": 605830, "name": "Glalie", "cleanName": "Glalie", "imageUrl": "https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/605830_200w.jpg", "categoryId": 85, "groupId": 23974, "url": "https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/605830/pokemon-japan-dp2-secret-of-the-lakes-glalie", "modifiedOn": "2025-08-19T18:37:04.77", "imageCount": 1, "presaleInfo": {"isPresale": false, "releasedOn": null, "note": null}, "extendedData": [{"name": "Rarity", "displayName": "Rarity", "value": "Rare"}, {"name": "Description", "displayName": "Description", "value": "<strong>Pok\u00e9-BODY: Craggy Face</strong> As long as Glalie is your Active Pok\u00e9mon, any damage done by attacks from your opponent's Stage 2 Evolved Pok\u00e9mon is reduced by 20 <em>(before applying Weakness and Resistance)</em>."}, {"name": "CardType", "displayName": "Card Type", "value": "Water"}, {"name": "HP", "displayName": "HP", "value": "90"}, {"name": "Stage", "displayName": "Stage", "value": "Stage 1"}, {"name": "Weakness", "displayName": "Weakness", "value": "Metal +20"}, {"name": "Retreat Cost", "displayName": "Retreat Cost", "value": "2"}, {"name": "Attack 1", "displayName": "Attack 1", "value": "[Water][Water][Colorless] Intimidation Pebble (50)<br> Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent can't play any Trainer cards or Supporter cards from his or her hand during your opponent's next turn."}, {"name": "Flavor Text", "displayName": "Flavor Text", "value": "To protect itself, it clads its body in an armor of ice, made by freezing moisture in the air."}]}, {"productId": 605831, "name": "Gyarados", "cleanName": "Gyarados", "imageUrl": "https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/605831_200w.jpg", "categoryId": 85, "groupId": 23974, "url": "https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/605831/pokemon-japan-dp2-secret-of-the-lakes-gyarados", "modifiedOn": "2025-08-20T22:37:14.463", "imageCount": 1, "presaleInfo": {"isPresale": false, "releasedOn": null, "note": null}, "extendedData": [{"name": "Rarity", "displayName": "Rarity", "value": "Rare"}, {"name": "Description", "displayName": "Description", "value": "<strong>Pok\u00e9-BODY: Dragon DNA</strong> Gyarados can use any attack from its Basic Pok\u00e9mon. (You still have to pay for that attack's Energy cost.) If Gyarados uses any attack from its Basic Pok\u00e9mon, that attack does 30 more damage to the Defending Pok\u00e9mon <em>(before applying Weakness and Resistance)</em>."}, {"name": "CardType", "displayName": "Card Type", "value": "Water"}, {"name": "HP", "displayName": "HP", "value": "120"}, {"name": "Stage", "displayName": "Stage", "value": "Stage 1"}, {"name": "Weakness", "displayName": "Weakness", "value": "Lightning +30"}, {"name": "Resistance", "displayName": "Resistance", "value": "Fighting -20"}, {"name": "Retreat Cost", "displayName": "Retreat Cost", "value": "3"}, {"name": "Attack 1", "displayName": "Attack 1", "value": "[Water][Water][Colorless][Colorless] Enrage (80)<br> Flip a coin until you get tails. For each heads, choose 1 card from your opponent's hand without looking and discard it. If the first coin is tails, Gyarados is now Confused."}, {"name": "Flavor Text", "displayName": "Flavor Text", "value": "Once it appears, its rage never settles until it has razed the fields and mountains around it."}]}, {"productId": 605832, "name": "Manectric", "cleanName": "Manectric", "imageUrl": "https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/605832_200w.jpg", "categoryId": 85, "groupId": 23974, "url": "https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/605832/pokemon-japan-dp2-secret-of-the-lakes-manectric", "modifiedOn": "2025-08-19T19:00:27.357", "imageCount": 1, "presaleInfo": {"isPresale": false, "releasedOn": null, "note": null}, "extendedData": [{"name": "Rarity", "displayName": "Rarity", "value": "Rare"}, {"name": "CardType", "displayName": "Card Type", "value": "Lightning"}, {"name": "HP", "displayName": "HP", "value": "80"}, {"name": "Stage", "displayName": "Stage", "value": "Stage 1"}, {"name": "Weakness", "displayName": "Weakness", "value": "Fighting +20"}, {"name": "Resistance", "displayName": "Resistance", "value": "Metal -20"}, {"name": "Attack 1", "displayName": "Attack 1", "value": "[Colorless] Lightning Twister (20x)<br> Does 20 damage times the number of basic Energy cards attached to Manectric."}, {"name": "Attack 2", "displayName": "Attack 2", "value": "[Lightning][Lightning][Lightning] Chain Lightning (70)<br> Does 20 damage to each of your opponent's Benched Pok\u00e9mon that is the same type as the Defending Pok\u00e9mon. <em>(Don't apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pok\u00e9mon.)</em>"}, {"name": "Flavor Text", "displayName": "Flavor Text", "value": "It discharges electricity from its mane. It creates a thundercloud overhead to drop lightning bolts."}]}, {"productId": 605833, "name": "Nidoqueen", "cleanName": "Nidoqueen", "imageUrl": "https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/605833_200w.jpg", "categoryId": 85, "groupId": 23974, "url": "https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/605833/pokemon-japan-dp2-secret-of-the-lakes-nidoqueen", "modifiedOn": "2025-08-20T22:50:14.593", "imageCount": 1, "presaleInfo": {"isPresale": false, "releasedOn": null, "note": null}, "extendedData": [{"name": "Rarity", "displayName": "Rarity", "value": "Rare"}, {"name": "Description", "displayName": "Description", "value": "<strong>Pok\u00e9-BODY: Mother Pheromone</strong> The attack cost of your NidoranF, Nidorina, NidoranM, Nidorino, and Nidoking's attacks is Colorless less."}, {"name": "CardType", "displayName": "Card Type", "value": "Psychic"}, {"name": "HP", "displayName": "HP", "value": "120"}, {"name": "Stage", "displayName": "Stage", "value": "Stage 2"}, {"name": "Weakness", "displayName": "Weakness", "value": "Psychic +30"}, {"name": "Resistance", "displayName": "Resistance", "value": "Lightning -20"}, {"name": "Retreat Cost", "displayName": "Retreat Cost", "value": "2"}, {"name": "Attack 1", "displayName": "Attack 1", "value": "[Psychic][Psychic][Colorless] Give Aid (90)<br> If you have the same number of or less Benched Pok\u00e9mon than your opponent, this attack's base damage is 50 instead of 90."}, {"name": "Flavor Text", "displayName": "Flavor Text", "value": "Its entire body is armored with hard scales. It will protect the young in its burrow with its life."}]}, {"productId": 605834, "name": "Walrein", "cleanName": "Walrein", "imageUrl": "https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/605834_200w.jpg", "categoryId": 85, "groupId": 23974, "url": "https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/605834/pokemon-japan-dp2-secret-of-the-lakes-walrein", "modifiedOn": "2025-08-20T22:56:49.793", "imageCount": 1, "presaleInfo": {"isPresale": false, "releasedOn": null, "note": null}, "extendedData": [{"name": "Rarity", "displayName": "Rarity", "value": "Rare"}, {"name": "Description", "displayName": "Description", "value": "<strong>Pok\u00e9-POWER: Freeze-up</strong> Once during your turn, when you play Walrein from your hand to evolve 1 of your Pok\u00e9mon, you may flip 2 coins. If both are heads, discard the Defending Pok\u00e9mon and all cards attached to it.  (This doesn't count as a Knocked Out Pok\u00e9mon.)"}, {"name": "CardType", "displayName": "Card Type", "value": "Water"}, {"name": "HP", "displayName": "HP", "value": "130"}, {"name": "Stage", "displayName": "Stage", "value": "Stage 2"}, {"name": "Weakness", "displayName": "Weakness", "value": "Metal +30"}, {"name": "Retreat Cost", "displayName": "Retreat Cost", "value": "3"}, {"name": "Attack 1", "displayName": "Attack 1", "value": "[Water][Water][Colorless] Ice Bind (70)<br> If your opponent doesn't discard a card from his or her hand, the Defending Pok\u00e9mon is now Paralyzed."}, {"name": "Flavor Text", "displayName": "Flavor Text", "value": "It shatters ice with its big tusks. Its thick blubber repels not only the cold, but also enemy attacks."}]}, {"productId": 605835, "name": "Ninetales", "cleanName": "Ninetales", "imageUrl": "https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/605835_200w.jpg", "categoryId": 85, "groupId": 23974, "url": "https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/605835/pokemon-japan-dp2-